{{Codex|The rapid-fire classic is the Orokin-engineered definition of silent, pinpoint lethality.}}

The '''Baza Prime''' is the [[Prime]] variant of the {{Weapon|Baza}} [[Noise Level|silenced]] submachine gun. In addition to improved [[Critical Chance]] and [[Status Chance]], it has higher [[Magazine Size]] and reserve ammo, faster [[Reload Speed]], and longer [[Damage Falloff]] range, reducing downtime from frequent reloading while increasing its effective range. Baza Prime was released alongside {{WF|Ivara Prime}} and {{Weapon|Aksomati Prime}}.

==Characteristics==
*This Weapon deals primarily {{D|Puncture}} Damage.
*This Weapon is [[Noise Level|Silent]].
*Low [[Zoom]] when aiming.
*Shorter [[Damage Falloff]] distance for a hit-scan Weapon.
{{Advantages|
*Very high [[Accuracy]] per shot, even at full auto.
*Negligible [[Recoil]].
*[[Noise Level|Silent]] nature allows for stealth usage.
*Lower Zoom allows for a more stable view.|name=Baza Prime}}
{{Disadvantages|
*Has linear Damage Falloff from 100% to 50% starting at 30m until 60m target distance (distances are affected by [[Projectile Speed]]).
**Cannot equip {{M|Terminal Velocity}}.
*Poor ammo economy.|name=Baza Prime}}

{{WeaponComparison|Baza}}

