*Tied with {{Weapon|Baza}} for the third fastest [[Fire Rate]] of all fully automatic rifles, behind {{Weapon|Grakata}} and {{Weapon|Prisma Grakata}}.
*Fastest [[Reload Speed]] of all fully automatic rifles.
*Tied with {{Weapon|Baza}} for the fourth lowest base Damage of all fully automatic rifles, after {{Weapon|Prisma Grakata}}, {{Weapon|Soma}}/{{Weapon|Soma Prime}}, and {{Weapon|Grakata}}; very reliant on its high Critical Damage potential.

